  "url": "https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium726.pdf",
  "notes": "Presence-based uptake bounds; recipe_g_l + concentration_mM retained. Undefined hydrolysates approximated as amino acids + nucleosides + vitamins (labeled).",
